{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675290/extras/About-Section-Banners_02.png?t=1749537226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crystal Gaiden Origins</strong> is a side-scrolling action platformer with a bold 8-bit aesthetic, pulsing chiptunes, and razor-sharp gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as a rogue warrior fighting through burning cities, buried ruins, high-tech research facilities, and an active orbital elevator primed to unleash a doomsday weapon \u2014 all in a collapsing sci-fi world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tear through rebel strongholds with advanced weaponry, and strike down your former brothers in the imperial army using forbidden powers buried in the past \u2014 all while uncovering a conspiracy that threatens the one you love. Trigger a berserk system that boosts your strength at the cost of your own health \u2014 every strike a sacrifice to bring her back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tribute to the 80s\u201390s era of NES action platformers \u2014 from Ninja Gaiden and Shatterhand to Castlevania and Shadow of the Ninja.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8-bit graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Side-scrolling Action Platformer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sharp controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Sub Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ types of enemies</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675290?t=1749537226","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675290/99d365d59713b4ed671d7e09e58e2ccad8042789/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749537226","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675290/01f7ba7f838935c